<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Roadmap — Linxira OS</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.8; }
    nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 2rem; background: rgba(14,20,23,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo img { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
    .nav-logo span { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #20B8B0; }
    .lang-link { background: rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); color: #e2e8f0; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    main { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 2rem 4rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #f1f5f9; }
    .subtitle { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #20B8B0; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; }
    .card { background: rgba(51,65,85,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .card h3 { color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .card .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 99px; margin-left: 0.5rem; vertical-align: middle; }
    .tag.done { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.2); color: #4DD8D0; }
    .tag.todo { background: rgba(234,179,8,0.15); color: #FACC15; }
    .tag.plan { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.15); color: #94a3b8; }
    .card p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .card ul { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/en/" class="nav-logo"><img src="/assets/linxira-l.svg" alt="Linxira"><span>Linxira OS</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/zeta/">Zeta</a>
      <a href="/en/docs/">Docs</a>
      <a href="/en/blog/">Blog</a>
      <a href="/en/legal/license/">License</a>
      <a href="/en/roadmap/" class="lang-link" style="color:#20B8B0;">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="/zh/roadmap/" class="lang-link">中文</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <main>
    <h1>Roadmap</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Desktop Supercomputer — full regular desktop functionality plus a headless mode for scientific computing, with lossless containers to reproduce other environments and let others reproduce ours.</p>

    <h2>Current (2026.08 beta)</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Beta released <span class="tag done">Done</span></h3>
      <ul>
        <li>93 curated applications (catalog v3), 14 categories</li>
        <li>Dual kernels: linux 7.1.5 (main) + linux-lts 6.18.41 (fallback)</li>
        <li>Timeshift + grub-btrfs snapshot rollback infrastructure</li>
        <li>Full container ecosystem: Podman / Distrobox / Apptainer / Docker</li>
        <li>Self-signed repository [linxira] + 17 first-party tools</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>2026.09 Official release</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Core upgrades <span class="tag todo">In progress</span></h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Image slimming: 4.6G → 2.5-3G (GNOME online-only, Plasma stays offline-installable)</li>
        <li>Memory optimization: ZRAM compressed swap + sysctl tuning (CachyOS-verified params)</li>
        <li>Dual-kernel GRUB menu: pick linux / linux-lts directly at boot</li>
        <li>Timeshift one-command setup: linxira-config timeshift enable (daily 3 snapshots)</li>
        <li>Containers default-on: Podman + Distrobox + Apptainer preselected at install</li>
        <li>Headless server mode: linxira-config headless on/off, zero desktop footprint for compute</li>
        <li>Pinned versions: OpenJDK 21 LTS, Node.js preinstalled</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Next iterations</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Full multi-desktop selection <span class="tag plan">Planned</span></h3>
      <p>Align with CachyOS at install time (KDE / GNOME / more), with desktop environments and tiling window managers managed separately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Recovery mode enhancements <span class="tag plan">Planned</span></h3>
      <p>Graphical restore UI: one-click image restore, boot repair, key repair; recovery environment defaults to KDE fallback desktop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Self-built performance kernel <span class="tag plan">Planned</span></h3>
      <p>Build from CachyOS open-source kernel (BORE scheduler + x86-64-v3 optimizations) into our own signed repository.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Tiling window managers <span class="tag plan">Planned</span></h3>
      <p>Niri / Hyprland and other tiling WMs into the software list, installable after KDE setup, switchable at the login screen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">Linxira OS — a desktop supercomputer system for science and development</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
